      "diatessaron_verse": "38",
      "ref": "Matthew 9:32",
      "arabic_page": 48,
      "text": "Sedang kedua orang buta itu keluar, dibawalah kepada Yesus seorang bisu yang kerasukan setan.",
      "ref_id": "Matius 9:32",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "diatessaron_verse": "39",
      "ref": "Matthew 9:33",
      "arabic_page": 48,
      "text": "Dan setelah setan itu diusir, dapatlah orang bisu itu berkata-kata. Maka heranlah orang banyak, katanya: \"Yang demikian belum pernah dilihat orang di Israel.\"",
      "ref_id": "Matius 9:33",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "diatessaron_verse": "40",
      "ref": "Matthew 9:35",
      "arabic_page": 48,
      "text": "Demikianlah Yesus berkeliling ke semua kota dan desa; Ia mengajar dalam rumah-rumah ibadat dan memberitakan Injil Kerajaan Sorga serta melenyapkan segala penyakit dan kelemahan.",
      "ref_id": "Matius 9:35",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "diatessaron_verse": "41",
      "ref": "Matthew 12:15b",
      "arabic_page": 49,
      "text": "Banyak orang mengikuti Yesus.",
      "ref_id": "Matius 12:15b",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "diatessaron_verse": "41",
      "ref": "Matthew 9:36",
      "arabic_page": 49,
      "text": "Melihat orang banyak itu, tergeraklah hati Yesus oleh belas kasihan kepada mereka, karena mereka lelah dan terlantar seperti domba",
      "ref_id": "Matius 9:36",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "diatessaron_verse": "42",
      "ref": "Matthew 9:36",
      "arabic_page": 49,
      "text": "yang tidak bergembala.",
      "ref_id": "Matius 9:36",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "diatessaron_verse": "42",
      "ref": "Luke 9:1",
      "arabic_page": 49,
      "text": "Maka Yesus memanggil kedua belas murid-Nya, lalu memberikan tenaga dan",
      "ref_id": "Lukas 9:1",
